# De Rosis & Enan, Phys. Fluids 33, 043315 (2021), Sec. III, first group:
# interface capture with a PRESCRIBED velocity -- no fluid operator involved.
# M3LB PhaseFieldBGK (conservative Allen-Cahn, their Sec. II.B) + Esoteric
# Pull, periodic everywhere, FP64. 2-D cases run with one periodic cell in z.
# e is their Eq. (71); Pe = U0 xi / M; T = L0/U0.
# The comparison column is their FD (Eq. 20) result: the moment gradient of
# their Eq. (70) is not implemented here -- it reads the node's own
# populations, which is a race under Esoteric Pull.
